{quote}Do you have an agreement in place with Rapid7? If so, please share. If not, we should put once in place. {quote}

We do not have an agreement in place with Rapid7. Its a free software they provide for anyone to use. The software license can be seen in the repository here [https://github.com/Velocidex/velociraptor?tab=License-1-ov-file|https://github.com/Velocidex/velociraptor?tab=License-1-ov-file|smart-link] If we do want to go the route of obtaining a subscription, they offer it as part of their InsightIDR ULTIMATE package. Pricing begins at $8.21 per asset per month at the scale of 250k assets. Assuming 4000 assets, that is $32840 per month or $394080 per year. Is the software license enough or would we need a subscription? 

{quote}Does the use of this tool relate to the ‘Employee WI-FI Data Signals’ project or is this something separate? {quote}

It is unrelated.

{quote}Will this tool be used to assist Internal Audit’s investigations or purely intended for use by InfoSec?{quote}

We are looking to enhance the capabilities of InfoSec team to assist in our incident response processes.

{quote}What timelines are you working to for rolling this out? {quote}

Ideally as soon as possible, but no specific timeline has been set.

Best,

Rasmus

